&lt;p&gt;I’m a Machine Learning Engineer focused on production ML, data engineering, and applied AI research. I like turning messy, real-world problems into simple, reliable systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;My goal with this site is to write clearly about the parts of ML that actually matter in practice. I dig into papers and implementations, chase the small details that change results, and share what I learn in plain language. Writing forces understanding; it’s how I stress-test ideas and make them useful.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Notes</title><link>https://bhushankarande.github.io/notes/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://bhushankarande.github.io/notes/</guid><description>&lt;div class="links-grid"&gt;
